title: Day01AfternoonPart01_03
---
Shelly: Hey, took you long enough. Who's this?
Me: Oh, he is Marvin. He's my classmate.
Marvin: Hello, uhh you are?
Shelly: Shelly! Nice to meet you.
Shelly: I'm Jerome's highschool friend.
Marvin: Ahh i see, Were you two close?
-> Yeah, we were!
    <<set $Shelly_lieThatSheIsClose = true>>
    <<set $Shelly_honestPoint -= 1>>
    Shelly: No, we weren't.
    <<if !$Shelly_knowingHerName>>
        Shelly: Dude, you didn't even remember my name.
    <<endif>>
-> Not really!
    <<set $Shelly_honestPoint += 1>>
    Shelly: Yeah, you got that right.
    <<if $Shelly_honestPoint >= 2>>
        <<set $Shelly_likePoint += 1>>
        Shelly: Although I regret not at least try to be close.
        Shelly: You're kinda alright.
    <<endif>>
-> *Says nothing!*
    Shelly: No, we weren't very close.
<<if $Shelly_lieThatSheIsClose>>
    Marvin: Ok, that's awkward.
    <<if $Marvin_quirkPoint >= 1>>
        Marvin: I'm sure that he just has a hazy memory.
    <<endif>>
<<else>>
    Marvin: Well, that's interesting.
<<endif>>
Marvin: Anyways, i feel like we should get lunch now.
Marvin: We only have about half an hour left before class starts again.
Me: Yeah, you're right. Let's go then.
<<if $Shelly_lieThatSheIsClose>>
    Shelly: Psh, fine.
<<else>>
    Shelly: Yep, alright.
<<endif>>
<<if $Marvin_quirkPoint >= 1>>
    Marvin: I take dibs on the seat next to you Jerome.
<<endif>>
<<set_object_inactive InteractiveDialogueTrigger02>>
<<wait_for_crossfade>>
<<set_object_active "AutoDialogueTrigger02">>
===
